  "changelog": "● Choose a resources folder or use app storage, with resource downloads available from the missing-resources prompt\n● Favorite Songs on the main menu, with heart buttons.\n● Left, center, and right search-panel positions for landscape playback.\n● Portrait search and reserved lists use the keypad area to keep the player visible above\n● Background Media Player playback: pressing Home keeps playback running, with notification controls for play/pause, previous, next, and Stop.\n● Automatic next: the Media Player advances to the next file and stops after the last one.\n● Picture-in-Picture for Media Player videos and KTV, with playback-focused layouts for the floating window.",
